# Day 29 - Operation Lifeline: Supply Chain Crisis Lab

## 📌 Project Overview

Today I built an **AI-powered Supply Chain Crisis Simulator** using Claude AI. This interactive application places users in the role of an enterprise decision-maker responsible for managing a major supply chain disruption.

The simulator demonstrates how AI can support strategic business decisions by balancing operational efficiency, supplier relationships, inventory management, customer satisfaction, and financial performance during crisis situations.

---

## 🚀 Features

* Interactive supply chain crisis simulation
* Random business scenario generation
* Executive decision dashboard
* Supplier negotiation rounds
* AI-assisted operational recommendations
* Business performance scoring
* Risk assessment and mitigation
* Inventory & logistics management
* Executive KPI dashboard
* Responsive React-based interface

---

## 🔄 Simulation Workflow

1. Start Business Simulation
2. Analyze Company Profile
3. Identify Supply Chain Crisis
4. Evaluate Business Risks
5. Choose Crisis Response Strategy
6. Negotiate with Suppliers
7. Answer CEO Decision Questions
8. Select AI Investments
9. Monitor Business KPIs
10. Review Final Executive Report

